s=\"bb_paragraph\">only one person working on this project which is myself and I am </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a college dropout student with a Digital Arts Media Certificate. I started </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">working on this project when I had my first Computer Programing class, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where I learned Python and which made me pursue other programming </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">languages like C#. Unity is the engine that I am using to make this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am not a professional. I try as hard as I can to bring my vision for </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this game into fruition and it may take longer than someone that knows </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">what they're doing but I hope you see the potential and come along the ride </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">that is 3D Joys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@WhoDisz</p>",
